# Paperboy

Use the `paperboy` MCP server (https://paperboyseo.com/mcp, bearer API key). Docs: https://paperboyseo.com/docs

- Start with `get_sites` to get the site id.
- `suggest_topics` costs 1 credit. `write_article` costs 12 credits and returns an id at once: poll `get_article` until the status is `published` or `needs_review`. `check_claims` costs 2 credits. Everything else is free.
- Say what a spending call costs before making it.
- Leave `publish` false. Show the article and its verdict, and call `publish_article` only after the user approves.
- Never put the API key in a file in the repo.
